      "description": "Data repository for solar and meteorological ground measurements from a network of weather stations in West Africa. The data is provided in the framework of the West African Power Pool project: \"Solar Development in Sub-Saharan Africa - Solar resource measurement campaign in West Africa”. Funding is provided by World Bank. Measurement Date Range: - Buchanan: 2022-02-25 – 2024-03-24 - Mount Coffee: 2021-06-12 – 2023-06-12 - Yekepa: 2022-03-16 – 2024-03-15",
